ungoogled-Chromium AppImage. It is not part of the MIT-licensed BeyondSlides
executable. The package retains the portable-build and Chromium licenses,
records the exact source URL and SHA-256 digest, and exposes Chromium's bundled
third-party notices through chrome://credits.

